# Overdub overlap-resolve and ledger evaluations

When changing **overlap resolve** or **ActiveNoteLedger** / occupy catch-up / playback-order logic, update the Guides so they still match the code. Do not leave the catalogs describing the previous evaluations.

**Read before editing those owners:**

- [`docs/Guides/OVERDUB_OVERLAP_RESOLVE_NOTE_EVALUATIONS.md`](docs/Guides/OVERDUB_OVERLAP_RESOLVE_NOTE_EVALUATIONS.md) — candidate select, classify, `resolveConstrainedGeometry`, pending, seal
- [`docs/Guides/OVERDUB_LEDGER_NOTE_EVALUATIONS.md`](docs/Guides/OVERDUB_LEDGER_NOTE_EVALUATIONS.md) — apply, emit vs mutate, catch-up vs clock, wrap exclusion, open ledger identities

They are **not** architecture authority. They are the durable evaluation catalogs.

## When a logic change lands

Update the matching catalog in the **same change** if any of these moved:

| If you changed | Update |
|---|---|
| `resolveConstrainedGeometry`, `classifyEditSessionInteraction`, `computeShortenedEndTick`, `accumulatePendingNoteChangesForIncomingNote`, `sealPendingNoteChangesToEditPasses`, `applyChangeLengthById` shorten/lengthen | overlap-resolve catalog |
| `ActiveNoteLedger::applyPlaybackEvent` / `noteOn`, `rebuildPlaybackOrder`, `CommittedPlaybackLedgerCatchUp`, `collectOverdubNoteOnParticipantIds`, wrap catch-up exclusion | ledger catalog |
| `rebuildOverdubSourceView`, `collectOverdubSourceHoldParticipantIds`, pending overlay vs cache | overlap-resolve catalog (handoff / covering identities) |

Keep the hard boundary: resolver owns exclusive-end geometry; ledger owns open identities; source-view covering identities answer present-at-hold. Do not couple those three because a CAP `n=` / `a=` mismatch looks suspicious.

## Primary files

Overlap resolve: `src/Loop/LoopPendingNoteChange.cpp`, `src/EditManager/ResolveConstrainedGeometry.cpp`, `src/EditManager/EditSessionInteraction.cpp`, `src/EditManager/EditApply.cpp`, `src/Track/TrackCaptureInput.cpp`, `src/Track/TrackOverdubWrap.cpp`, `src/Loop/LoopCapture.cpp`.

Ledger: `include/ActiveNoteLedger.h`, `src/ActiveNoteLedger.cpp`, `include/Utils/CommittedPlaybackLedgerCatchUp.h`, `src/Utils/CommittedPlaybackLedgerCatchUp.cpp`, `src/Track/TrackPlaybackWindowBuild.cpp`, `src/Track/TrackPlaybackHotPath.cpp`.
